  "coverageGaps": [
    "No live candidate evidence exists until a source-bound digest receipt is supplied and the scenario finishes.",
    "Compiled infrastructure is not live coverage. blockedReason prevents provisioning before its missing execution/proof adapter exists.",
    "Operator empty/omitted-secret watch enforcement requires the runtime official regional default to be at least Kubernetes1.37; unsupported/skipped is not a pass and no older version is pinned.",
    "The mixed profile requires source-bound ARM64 and both Windows2022/2025 candidate image build families before provisioning.",
    "Windows2019 is unsupported on currently supported official Kubernetes versions; do not pin older Kubernetes to recreate it.",
    "Arc onboarding and CCP standalone health validation require their separate authorized adapters; ordinary AKS is not equivalent.",
    "regionTests requires region/rule parameters and is not included in the cluster health suite.",
    "Customer Helm installation requires an isolated helmChartInstall target; never apply customer Helm values to the managed-addon backdoor chart.",
    "Per-profile measured time/cost and Azure what-if/live proof are pending; tier recommendations do not imply successful executions."
  ]
